WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.080 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 11=

01:39.760 --> 01:40.719
The garrison

01:40.719 --> 01:41.920
runs on a strict hierarchy.

01:42.040 --> 01:43.400
Our husbands all have

01:43.400 --> 01:44.760
different ranks.

01:45.040 --> 01:46.640
So where military families live

01:46.640 --> 01:48.680
depends on rank too.

01:49.400 --> 01:50.599
Families of Banner Commanders

01:50.599 --> 01:52.319
and anyone below them

01:52.599 --> 01:53.519
live right here,

01:53.799 --> 01:54.680
in Desheng Ward.

01:55.239 --> 01:56.239
But someday,

01:56.480 --> 01:57.760
if your man

01:57.760 --> 01:59.319
gets promoted to company commander,

01:59.680 --> 02:02.840
you can move into a three-courtyard
brick house on South Street.

02:03.480 --> 02:04.439
And if

02:04.439 --> 02:06.000
he makes battalion commander,

02:06.000 --> 02:07.959
you can move
near the Commander's Office,

02:07.959 --> 02:09.439
into one of those grand carved mansions
to the east.

02:09.560 --> 02:10.520
Even their thresholds

02:10.759 --> 02:12.879
stand nine cun higher
than ordinary homes.

02:14.080 --> 02:14.800
But for now,

02:15.039 --> 02:16.520
your place

02:16.879 --> 02:17.639
is right over there.

02:23.159 --> 02:24.120
Ma!

02:24.199 --> 02:24.960
Quit singing!

02:25.159 --> 02:26.599
You're killing my ears!

02:27.919 --> 02:28.599
So,

02:28.599 --> 02:30.919
do we buy our own daily supplies,

02:30.919 --> 02:32.199
or does the garrison provide them?

02:32.599 --> 02:33.560
That

02:33.560 --> 02:34.840
depends on rank too.

02:35.039 --> 02:36.000
Around here,

02:36.120 --> 02:37.080
money

02:37.280 --> 02:38.800
can't buy you everything.

02:38.960 --> 02:39.919
Sometimes,

02:39.919 --> 02:40.919
even getting water

02:40.919 --> 02:42.439
means waiting for your assigned time.

02:42.919 --> 02:43.919
And that's not even counting

02:44.000 --> 02:45.360
my husband's rank.

02:46.080 --> 02:47.159
My younger brother

02:47.159 --> 02:48.319
is an officer too.

02:48.680 --> 02:50.240
He's a deputy battalion commander.

02:50.599 --> 02:52.400
So we get special treatment
in just about everything.

02:52.400 --> 02:52.800
Go.

02:53.599 --> 02:55.120
That's why I say, Miss Xie,

02:55.360 --> 02:56.360
if a woman

02:56.360 --> 02:57.719
wants a good life,

02:58.599 --> 03:00.120
she still needs a man to rely on.

03:03.639 --> 03:05.479
The place is a little run-down,

03:06.240 --> 03:07.840
but with some work,

03:08.280 --> 03:10.159
we can make it feel like home.

03:17.080 --> 03:18.120
Well then,

03:18.120 --> 03:19.199
I'll let you get settled.

03:19.400 --> 03:20.520
I won't keep you.

03:27.360 --> 03:28.520
Come catch me!

03:54.879 --> 03:56.199
I'll reach senior fifth rank
as soon as I can,

03:57.680 --> 03:58.560
and take everyone back to the capital.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.719
Of course I believe in you.

04:16.000 --> 04:17.160
Concubine Lu was the one

04:17.160 --> 04:19.000
who took your velvet flower
in the first place.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.199
You were kind enough

04:20.199 --> 04:21.160
to save her from embarrassment,

04:21.240 --> 04:22.160
and look what happened.

04:22.360 --> 04:23.519
Now you've offended Madam Mo.

04:24.560 --> 04:25.720
Who would've thought

04:25.720 --> 04:27.759
a general's wife could be so petty,

04:27.759 --> 04:29.319
putting someone on the spot like that?

04:29.600 --> 04:30.720
Whatever's going on
between his wife and concubine

04:30.879 --> 04:32.199
is Mo's family business.

04:32.759 --> 04:34.519
Those two already had bad blood.

04:35.759 --> 04:36.759
They just dragged you into it.

04:36.839 --> 04:38.319
It's not like we went looking
for trouble.

04:38.680 --> 04:39.240
From now on,

04:39.879 --> 04:40.839
keep your distance from them.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.240
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

04:44.839 --> 04:46.279
People show their true colors with time.

04:46.879 --> 04:47.720
As for you,

04:47.720 --> 04:49.839
focus on your duties

04:49.839 --> 04:51.040
and get yourself established.

04:51.199 --> 04:53.920
I'll decide for myself

04:53.920 --> 04:54.920
how to deal with the officers' wives.

04:56.079 --> 04:57.240
I trust you.

04:58.160 --> 04:59.240
But promise me

04:59.759 --> 05:01.000
you won't take unnecessary risks.

05:03.120 --> 05:04.560
I'll be at the barracks from now on.

05:04.839 --> 05:05.879
If anything happens,

05:08.720 --> 05:10.000
have Sen send word to me.

05:12.800 --> 05:13.480
Go on.

05:13.959 --> 05:14.879
We can handle

05:15.319 --> 05:16.160
the rest of this.

05:18.839 --> 05:19.720
All right.

05:24.240 --> 05:25.480
Ganlin may be a frontier town,

05:26.079 --> 05:27.160
but it's not exactly the front line.

05:28.480 --> 05:29.480
In the army,

05:29.480 --> 05:30.639
if you want to move up,

05:31.040 --> 05:32.399
you either rack up enough enemy kills

05:32.600 --> 05:33.480
or pull off something extraordinary.

05:33.720 --> 05:35.000
But you just got here.

05:35.920 --> 05:36.959
You're not going

05:37.040 --> 05:38.360
to see combat anytime soon.

05:38.839 --> 05:40.199
Then how are we supposed
to earn any merit?

05:42.279 --> 05:43.360
Camp rules say

05:43.560 --> 05:44.720
they put up a red-ribbon target
every month.

05:46.319 --> 05:47.879
Anyone who hits it is marked
as outstanding

05:48.120 --> 05:49.120
and gets first shot

05:49.120 --> 05:49.720
at any chance to earn merit.

05:50.399 --> 05:51.839
Then why isn't everyone going for it?

05:52.879 --> 05:54.319
The other camps took theirs down
ages ago.

05:55.120 --> 05:56.079
But here,

05:56.439 --> 05:57.600
Commander Lu missed his,

05:58.000 --> 05:58.800
(Lu Dahu, Deputy Battalion Commander)
so no one dares take it from him.

05:59.279 --> 06:00.319
Commander Lu?

06:00.399 --> 06:01.959
What's so special about him?

06:02.040 --> 06:03.399
Nobody dares outdo him?

06:04.079 --> 06:05.439
General Mo didn't tell you?

06:05.959 --> 06:07.079
He's his brother-in-law

06:07.639 --> 06:08.879
and a deputy battalion commander.

06:10.399 --> 06:11.600
This bow's a piece of junk.

06:14.160 --> 06:15.759
There is a Concubine Lu.

06:17.000 --> 06:17.879
General Mo.

06:18.800 --> 06:19.519
General Mo!

06:21.319 --> 06:22.000
Yi!

06:26.639 --> 06:27.480
Zhao.

06:29.920 --> 06:30.759
General Mo.

06:33.240 --> 06:33.720
Here.

06:36.759 --> 06:37.600
Take it.

06:43.319 --> 06:44.319
I can't accept this.

06:44.439 --> 06:45.920
Why not?

06:46.560 --> 06:47.519
This bow

06:48.000 --> 06:49.079
was meant for the man

06:49.079 --> 06:50.759
who distinguished himself
in the Yongning investigation.

06:50.839 --> 06:52.040
You've more than earned it.

06:52.319 --> 06:53.480
It'd be wrong

06:53.480 --> 06:54.600
for me to keep it for myself.

06:55.079 --> 06:55.759
Trust me.

06:56.120 --> 06:56.519
Take it.

07:03.360 --> 07:04.199
Zhao,

07:04.600 --> 07:05.480
listen to me.

07:06.199 --> 07:07.240
Don't rush things.

07:07.600 --> 07:08.959
Compared with Shaqiong Town,

07:08.959 --> 07:10.639
we've got too many men chasing
too few opportunities.

07:10.959 --> 07:11.920
But you've got

07:12.160 --> 07:13.439
the Sixteenth Master's recommendation.

07:13.600 --> 07:15.360
Once you've earned some merit,

07:15.600 --> 07:16.360
Commander Wang

07:16.560 --> 07:18.240
will surely consider you for promotion.

07:22.600 --> 07:23.920
Thank you for the advice, General Mo.

07:24.000 --> 07:24.720
All right.

07:24.959 --> 07:25.800
Go on. Try the bow.

07:31.319 --> 07:31.879
Look at that.

07:32.879 --> 07:34.040
That's a nice bow.

07:34.279 --> 07:36.240
Unbelievable.

07:36.759 --> 07:37.480
Let me try it.

07:37.480 --> 07:39.920
I even let my sister
become his mistress,

07:40.879 --> 07:41.920
and he gives that bow to someone else?

07:41.920 --> 07:42.360
Mr. Zhao,

07:42.480 --> 07:43.319
with a bow like this,

07:43.399 --> 07:44.439
you could hit anything
at a hundred paces.

08:00.399 --> 08:01.120
Go back.

08:02.399 --> 08:03.240
Go.

08:08.640 --> 08:09.839
(Virtuous, Serene and Proper)

08:09.839 --> 08:10.720
You are dismissed.

08:12.639 --> 08:14.480
How is it still this hot
this time of year?

08:14.480 --> 08:15.680
It is strange.

08:16.639 --> 08:18.160
Well, if it isn't Madam Mo.

08:24.279 --> 08:25.959
Here to pick up your eldest daughter?

08:25.959 --> 08:26.759
That's right.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.360
I hear

08:28.680 --> 08:30.120
there's a new young lady in town.

08:30.560 --> 08:32.080
How are you getting along?

08:34.399 --> 08:35.399
She's too good for the likes of me.

08:36.600 --> 08:37.320
Can't say I'm surprised.

08:38.000 --> 08:39.559
Just look at Miss Xie.

08:39.679 --> 08:40.840
Everything she eats and uses,

08:40.840 --> 08:41.799
everything she wears...

08:41.960 --> 08:43.039
it's all so refined.

08:43.399 --> 08:45.000
She's not one of us.

08:45.559 --> 08:47.559
She probably sees us
as country bumpkins.

08:47.559 --> 08:48.879
Why would she bother getting close
to us?

08:48.960 --> 08:50.480
All she has to do is play a few tricks,

08:50.480 --> 08:51.840
get what she wants and walk away.

08:52.360 --> 08:53.879
If she keeps playing clever like this

08:53.960 --> 08:56.440
and actually gets established in Ganlin,

08:56.440 --> 08:57.919
the rest of us

08:58.039 --> 09:00.159
will end up dancing to her tune.

09:03.919 --> 09:05.399
Just look at Concubine Lu.

09:06.039 --> 09:07.159
Before,

09:07.159 --> 09:08.360
nobody could stand her.

09:08.519 --> 09:10.200
Now that she's got someone on her side,

09:10.600 --> 09:11.919
she's suddenly

09:12.080 --> 09:13.879
walking around with her head held high.

09:26.039 --> 09:26.639
Miss Xie,

09:26.919 --> 09:28.799
the fields granted
by the Sixteenth Master were taken.

09:30.759 --> 09:31.879
Taken it over?

09:32.960 --> 09:34.399
We have the deed.

09:34.399 --> 09:35.879
The authorities only just granted us
that land.

09:35.879 --> 09:37.120
How can someone just take it?

09:37.200 --> 09:38.159
Is there no law around here?

09:38.279 --> 09:39.639
They don't care about deeds here.

09:39.720 --> 09:40.799
It's all women and children.

09:41.440 --> 09:42.600
They insist it was wasteland

09:42.600 --> 09:43.840
and they've been farming it for years.

09:44.799 --> 09:45.799
I couldn't win the argument.

09:49.440 --> 09:50.200
I'll go.

09:50.960 --> 09:51.639
Sanniang.

09:53.720 --> 09:55.639
Then where did these bamboo slips
come from?

09:56.120 --> 09:58.000
There are old battlefield graves
from the previous dynasty on the land.

09:58.200 --> 09:58.960
They said

09:59.320 --> 10:01.039
we could keep whatever they dug up.

10:01.919 --> 10:03.000
It's all worthless junk.

10:03.000 --> 10:04.279
They're doing this just to spite us.

10:04.679 --> 10:05.639
From graves?

10:06.840 --> 10:08.000
That's bad luck.

10:08.000 --> 10:09.039
Exactly.

10:34.840 --> 10:37.680
(Mo Residence)

10:38.240 --> 10:39.720
We're all brothers in arms.

10:40.440 --> 10:41.399
And now you've seized

10:41.639 --> 10:43.440
Banner Commander Zhao's fields.

10:43.559 --> 10:44.679
How can I face anyone

10:44.679 --> 10:45.679
in the military now?

10:45.799 --> 10:46.759
His fields?

10:46.879 --> 10:47.840
I reclaimed the wasteland!

10:48.840 --> 10:50.519
That land sat abandoned for
over ten years.

10:51.000 --> 10:52.600
The weeds were taller than a man.

10:52.799 --> 10:54.240
I took people out there myself

10:54.240 --> 10:56.000
and cleared it little by little.

10:56.320 --> 10:57.399
We've got three children

10:57.679 --> 10:58.759
to provide for.

10:59.360 --> 11:01.320
Meanwhile, you get to stay out all day

11:01.320 --> 11:02.519
and leave everything to me.

11:02.879 --> 11:04.360
You've never lifted a finger
in the fields,

11:04.360 --> 11:05.879
and you're still keeping another woman!

11:05.879 --> 11:06.639
Here we go again.

11:06.720 --> 11:07.759
Amazing.

11:08.000 --> 11:09.960
What respectable man these days

11:09.960 --> 11:11.360
doesn't have a few concubines
and mistresses?

11:11.360 --> 11:12.759
What's the big deal?

11:16.919 --> 11:18.960
So that Lu woman isn't enough for you?

11:19.559 --> 11:20.879
You want another one?

11:21.200 --> 11:22.039
Why don't you just

11:22.039 --> 11:22.919
go after that Xie woman?

11:22.919 --> 11:23.240
You...

11:23.679 --> 11:25.600
She's even prettier than that Lu,

11:26.159 --> 11:27.000
and that figure of hers

11:27.080 --> 11:28.759
puts Lu's to shame!

11:28.919 --> 11:30.759
Go on, then! Go get her!

11:31.879 --> 11:33.440
Shameless!

11:33.440 --> 11:35.200
Have you got no shame at all?

11:35.559 --> 11:37.679
Mo, you rotten scumbag!

11:37.679 --> 11:38.480
Just you dare go near her!

11:38.480 --> 11:39.639
I...

11:39.639 --> 11:40.679
I'll break her legs!

11:41.519 --> 11:42.559
Sorry about that, Miss Xie.

11:42.559 --> 11:44.800
(Mo Residence)

11:47.399 --> 11:49.240
Maybe we shouldn't go in.

11:58.399 --> 11:59.679
How was it with Madam Mo today?

12:03.080 --> 12:03.919
Didn't go very well.

12:04.799 --> 12:05.960
Madam Mo

12:06.159 --> 12:08.120
is a complete shrew.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.559
The other military families

12:27.679 --> 12:29.480
are afraid the land they're reassigned

12:29.600 --> 12:31.159
won't be as fertile as ours,

12:31.240 --> 12:32.559
so they refuse to give it up.

12:33.240 --> 12:34.279
As for Madam Mo,

12:34.279 --> 12:35.519
she's still holding a grudge

12:35.519 --> 12:37.039
over what happened when we first met

12:37.039 --> 12:37.919
and is giving me a hard time.

12:39.960 --> 12:42.919
I never meant to get dragged
into the Mo family's domestic feud,

12:43.399 --> 12:44.480
nor do I want to make enemies

12:44.480 --> 12:46.000
of the military families farming
that land.

12:46.600 --> 12:47.440
But now,

12:47.960 --> 12:49.759
I'm caught in the middle.

12:50.000 --> 12:51.159
If it's really that much trouble,

12:51.919 --> 12:52.679
then maybe this land

12:53.120 --> 12:53.960
isn't worth fighting over.

12:54.600 --> 12:55.799
You can't reason with people

12:56.000 --> 12:57.240
who refuse to listen.

12:59.399 --> 13:01.279
If we can't even hold on
to a piece of land,

13:02.320 --> 13:03.360
how are we supposed

13:03.759 --> 13:04.960
to make a life here?

13:06.320 --> 13:07.279
And then,

13:07.600 --> 13:09.320
what will people think of you?

13:09.799 --> 13:11.000
Even in the army,

13:11.120 --> 13:13.000
people may start looking down on you.

13:15.039 --> 13:16.120
So this land...

13:17.320 --> 13:18.279
we're not giving it up.

13:19.519 --> 13:20.080
All right.

13:21.720 --> 13:22.600
If you want to fight for it,

13:23.559 --> 13:24.240
then we'll fight for it.

13:25.440 --> 13:26.919
These dates are good today.

13:26.919 --> 13:27.480
Yeah.

13:27.600 --> 13:28.039
Big and plump.

13:28.039 --> 13:28.879
Come catch me!

13:29.240 --> 13:29.919
Biao.

13:30.399 --> 13:31.240
Did you hear?

13:31.799 --> 13:32.759
The authorities

13:32.759 --> 13:33.919
need land for a cemetery.

13:34.080 --> 13:35.159
And they've chosen

13:35.159 --> 13:37.120
the plot that belongs to Miss Xie.

13:37.200 --> 13:38.200
Seriously?

13:38.200 --> 13:38.840
It's true.

13:38.840 --> 13:39.679
A cemetery?

13:39.679 --> 13:40.159
Yeah.

13:41.240 --> 13:43.600
Isn't that the land we're farming?

13:45.279 --> 13:46.679
They did dig up

13:46.799 --> 13:48.639
human bones there years ago.

13:48.840 --> 13:50.600
Makes sense they'd turn it
into a cemetery.

13:50.840 --> 13:52.399
We need to tell Madam Mo right away.

13:52.399 --> 13:53.240
Yeah.

13:53.320 --> 13:53.759
Well...

13:56.800 --> 13:58.360
(Madam Mo, nee Zhou)

13:58.360 --> 14:00.120
(Signed and sealed by Sun Zhen)

14:00.559 --> 14:01.600
Madam Mo,

14:02.120 --> 14:04.559
once the new deed is issued
in a couple of days,

14:04.559 --> 14:06.440
someone will deliver it
to your residence.

14:06.759 --> 14:07.919
Thank you for the trouble.

14:08.159 --> 14:09.000
Of course.

14:09.600 --> 14:10.679
My turn.

14:11.320 --> 14:13.080
(Contracting Party: Lin Sisheng)
It should be filed in Xie's name.

14:13.360 --> 14:14.679
Well, that's strange.

14:14.679 --> 14:15.840
Usually,

14:16.080 --> 14:17.320
you all fight

14:17.320 --> 14:18.879
over this land.

14:19.159 --> 14:19.960
Why are you

14:19.960 --> 14:21.200
giving it up so easily today?

14:21.720 --> 14:22.799
Surely you jest, My Lord.

14:23.159 --> 14:25.519
If the authorities need that land
for a cemetery,

14:25.639 --> 14:26.879
then as military families,

14:27.000 --> 14:28.399
of course we'll cooperate.

14:28.799 --> 14:29.759
A cemetery?

14:30.080 --> 14:31.519
Where did you hear that?

14:32.840 --> 14:33.559
My Lord,

14:33.960 --> 14:35.679
we heard just a few days ago

14:35.679 --> 14:37.960
that Miss Xie's land was being taken
for a cemetery.

14:38.679 --> 14:39.720
That's not true.

14:39.799 --> 14:41.480
Now that the deeds have been corrected,

14:41.480 --> 14:42.679
the matter is settled.

14:42.679 --> 14:43.679
From now on,

14:43.879 --> 14:45.320
you tend your own fields,

14:45.440 --> 14:46.480
and Miss Xie tends hers.

14:46.960 --> 14:48.799
Let's have no more pointless disputes.

14:48.799 --> 14:50.399
She tricked us.

14:50.679 --> 14:51.960
Now we're the ones who lose out.

14:51.960 --> 14:53.080
Exactly.

14:54.280 --> 14:57.560
(One Month Later)

15:11.440 --> 15:12.360
Miss Xie.

15:12.440 --> 15:13.679
Mr. Zhao's back!

15:30.679 --> 15:31.320
Mr. Zhao.

15:31.440 --> 15:32.840
It's been so long
since you've been home.

15:41.960 --> 15:43.120
I just came back for some clothes.

15:47.600 --> 15:48.080
Here.

16:21.919 --> 16:23.080
It's a long trip.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.759
You don't have to come
all this way every time.

16:25.840 --> 16:26.639
Sen

16:27.039 --> 16:28.360
is at an age when he needs
some guidance.

16:29.399 --> 16:30.200
I just

16:30.840 --> 16:31.960
came back to check on him.

16:32.759 --> 16:33.240
I'm off.

16:33.440 --> 16:34.879
Be careful on the way back.

16:48.200 --> 16:48.679
What...

16:49.399 --> 16:50.600
What happened?

16:51.159 --> 16:52.840
The horse stepped on a caltrop.

16:52.919 --> 16:53.679
Its hoof is injured.

16:59.960 --> 17:01.559
It won't be fit to ride tonight.

17:02.679 --> 17:03.320
Sanniang,

17:04.039 --> 17:04.880
have Zheng San

17:05.079 --> 17:06.079
take the horse and tend to it.

17:06.079 --> 17:06.720
Okay.

17:06.720 --> 17:07.279
Go.

17:10.079 --> 17:11.160
What about you, Mr. Zhao?

17:12.839 --> 17:14.160
I'm not on leave today.

17:14.680 --> 17:15.640
I have to get back to camp.

17:16.480 --> 17:17.440
But don't worry.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.240
These past few days,

17:18.359 --> 17:19.680
I've learned the terrain.

17:20.279 --> 17:21.119
Traveling at night

17:21.759 --> 17:22.519
won't be a problem.

17:23.759 --> 17:25.279
At this hour?

17:25.720 --> 17:26.960
Out in the wilderness?

17:27.519 --> 17:28.799
What if you run into

17:28.799 --> 17:30.240
wild beasts out there?

17:30.359 --> 17:31.400
It's too dangerous.

17:33.680 --> 17:35.440
Life on the frontier is different.

17:35.799 --> 17:36.960
Some rules

17:37.079 --> 17:38.519
don't have to be followed to the letter.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.960
Your horse is injured,

17:41.519 --> 17:43.240
and you don't have another mount.

17:43.519 --> 17:44.480
We can't have you

17:44.559 --> 17:46.720
walking all night
just to get back to camp.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.079
Tomorrow morning,

17:50.079 --> 17:51.160
I'll have Zheng San

17:51.720 --> 17:53.880
find you a fast horse,
and you can ride back then.

17:55.519 --> 17:57.839
Stay in the east room tonight, Mr. Zhao.

17:58.799 --> 18:00.680
That room was meant for you anyway.

18:17.240 --> 18:18.920
Bring the horse inside,

18:19.440 --> 18:21.200
and no one will know
you stayed the night.

18:23.559 --> 18:25.039
If you stay out here

18:25.039 --> 18:26.359
any longer,

18:26.880 --> 18:28.759
everyone will find out.

18:44.920 --> 18:46.319
It's your house

18:46.319 --> 18:47.359
and your room.

18:47.680 --> 18:49.160
Why do you have to hide the fact
you're staying here?

18:49.440 --> 18:51.079
Miss Xie and I aren't married yet.

18:51.519 --> 18:52.759
Living under the same roof

18:52.960 --> 18:53.759
wouldn't be proper.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.640
Her reputation is at stake.

18:58.000 --> 18:58.640
So don't let

18:59.039 --> 18:59.920
anyone know about this.

19:00.759 --> 19:01.359
Put that away.

19:35.560 --> 19:39.760
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

19:43.760 --> 19:48.480
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

19:49.760 --> 19:54.440
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

19:54.440 --> 19:57.320
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

19:57.920 --> 19:58.960
Get some rest.

20:01.680 --> 20:03.600
♪But I can't♪

20:07.440 --> 20:09.000
You too.

20:10.280 --> 20:14.080
♪Fill my eyes with tears♪

20:14.080 --> 20:20.560
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

20:21.600 --> 20:25.600
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

20:25.600 --> 20:30.160
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

20:30.160 --> 20:35.480
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

20:41.480 --> 20:42.119
Commander.

20:43.079 --> 20:44.240
At last night's roll call,

20:44.680 --> 20:45.880
excluding those with night passes,

20:45.880 --> 20:46.640
three men were absent.

20:47.559 --> 20:48.440
Banner Commander Li

20:48.440 --> 20:49.400
went home to help with the farm

20:49.599 --> 20:50.599
and returned before midnight.

20:51.000 --> 20:51.880
Banner Commander Sun

20:51.880 --> 20:52.759
left because his mother
fell seriously ill

20:53.000 --> 20:53.920
without requesting a pass.

20:54.480 --> 20:55.839
I'll give you a demerit for now.

20:56.400 --> 20:57.160
You can make up for it

20:57.240 --> 20:58.400
with merit in the future.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.079
Thank you, sir.

20:59.079 --> 21:00.720
Hurry! Where have you been?

21:00.720 --> 21:02.119
Lu Dahu pulled a dirty trick last night.

21:02.119 --> 21:02.720
He saw you were gone

21:02.720 --> 21:04.200
and called a surprise roll call.

21:04.680 --> 21:05.480
But don't worry.

21:05.839 --> 21:07.119
Just tell them

21:07.119 --> 21:08.759
you stayed at Miss Xie's place
last night.

21:08.759 --> 21:09.839
We're not at war.

21:09.839 --> 21:11.519
At worst, Commander Wang
will chew you out,

21:11.519 --> 21:12.559
and that'll be the end of it.

21:14.279 --> 21:15.039
No.

21:15.960 --> 21:17.440
Miss Xie and I aren't married yet.

21:18.200 --> 21:19.839
If I admit I spent the night there,

21:20.240 --> 21:21.480
what happens to her reputation?

21:22.920 --> 21:24.720
bout the third man?

21:25.400 --> 21:26.480
Banner Commander Zhao

21:27.039 --> 21:29.119
didn't return until this morning.

21:35.240 --> 21:36.039
Zhao Ling.

21:36.279 --> 21:38.160
Where were you last night?

21:43.839 --> 21:45.200
I got drunk at a tavern east of town

21:46.319 --> 21:47.039
and overslept.

21:50.079 --> 21:51.119
Banner Commander Zhao,

21:51.480 --> 21:53.000
you were absent without leave,

21:53.640 --> 21:54.960
abandoning your post.

21:55.799 --> 21:56.880
By military law,

21:57.160 --> 21:58.759
that's eighty strokes

21:59.640 --> 22:01.039
and three months' pay docked.

22:02.000 --> 22:02.960
Banner Commander Zhao,

22:03.319 --> 22:05.000
you only spent the night at home.

22:05.319 --> 22:07.200
Why not just say family matters
made you miss roll call?

22:07.319 --> 22:08.960
Once you and Miss Xie are married,

22:08.960 --> 22:09.680
you'll be living together anyway.

22:09.680 --> 22:10.680
I left camp without permission,

22:11.839 --> 22:12.799
got drunk and missed duty.

22:13.880 --> 22:14.799
I'll take the punishment.

22:15.839 --> 22:16.640
Fine.

22:17.079 --> 22:17.799
Zhao Ling,

22:19.039 --> 22:21.519
you talk about keeping your head high

22:21.519 --> 22:23.119
and your feet on the ground.

22:23.599 --> 22:25.680
You have no regard for military law

22:25.759 --> 22:26.880
and you're utterly arrogant!

22:27.799 --> 22:28.799
Without severe punishment,

22:29.200 --> 22:30.519
how can discipline be maintained?

22:31.960 --> 22:32.640
Guards!

22:34.480 --> 22:35.720
Eighty strokes.

22:36.000 --> 22:37.400
Not one less.

22:38.599 --> 22:39.319
Commander!

22:40.359 --> 22:40.960
I'll

22:41.319 --> 22:42.440
take twenty strokes

22:42.440 --> 22:43.519
for Banner Commander Zhao.

22:44.000 --> 22:44.799
I'll take twenty too.

22:45.039 --> 22:45.960
So will I.

22:46.559 --> 22:47.599
Very well.

22:47.680 --> 22:48.720
If that's what you want,

22:49.079 --> 22:50.359
I'll grant it.

22:55.079 --> 22:55.920
Thank you.

22:57.359 --> 22:58.000
Strike!

22:58.720 --> 22:59.359
Yes, sir.

23:04.400 --> 23:05.319
Picking dates all day

23:05.319 --> 23:06.839
nearly broke my back.

23:06.839 --> 23:07.279
Tell me about it.

23:13.319 --> 23:14.400
How are you, Mr. Zhao?

23:14.960 --> 23:16.039
It's nothing.

23:16.400 --> 23:17.519
I've had much worse.

23:28.240 --> 23:29.039
Mr. Zhao.

23:29.039 --> 23:29.480
What...?

23:33.279 --> 23:33.920
Well,

23:33.920 --> 23:35.599
as soon as Miss Xie heard what happened,

23:35.599 --> 23:36.920
she was worried sick.

23:36.920 --> 23:38.000
She had all this medicine

23:38.079 --> 23:39.119
prepared for you.

23:42.319 --> 23:43.240
I'm fine.

23:44.319 --> 23:45.240
Sorry I worried you.

23:46.720 --> 23:48.079
Is it bad?

23:48.480 --> 23:50.440
Don't cause any problems later.

23:59.000 --> 23:59.880
Does it hurt?

24:01.160 --> 24:02.400
The salve at camp isn't very good,

24:03.400 --> 24:04.480
and it's been freezing.

24:04.640 --> 24:06.039
I think I got frostbite.

24:07.720 --> 24:08.279
Oh...

24:08.480 --> 24:09.160
Sanniang,

24:09.359 --> 24:09.920
quick.

24:10.039 --> 24:11.319
Take this wound salve

24:11.319 --> 24:12.279
and give some to the others.

24:12.359 --> 24:12.920
Sure.

24:18.279 --> 24:19.599
Mr. Zhao, your injury...

24:20.680 --> 24:21.960
Let me take a look.

24:23.799 --> 24:25.160
This might hurt a little.

24:32.039 --> 24:32.839
I'll be gentle.

24:39.920 --> 24:40.359
I...

24:40.680 --> 24:41.160
I'll...

24:43.279 --> 24:44.359
I'll be even gentler.

24:44.359 --> 24:46.359
Didn't we all get twenty strokes?

24:47.680 --> 24:48.400
Was the one

24:48.519 --> 24:49.720
who struck Mr. Zhao

24:49.720 --> 24:51.039
particularly heavy-handed?

24:52.240 --> 24:53.680
Still, that couldn't have been worse

24:54.200 --> 24:55.640
than the beatings he used to get

24:55.640 --> 24:57.440
for selling salt, could it?

24:58.680 --> 24:59.880
I...I'll be gentle!

24:59.880 --> 25:00.720
Ow!

25:01.240 --> 25:02.160
You little rascal.

25:02.160 --> 25:03.119
You shouldn't be looking at this.

25:03.119 --> 25:03.440
Go.

25:03.960 --> 25:04.400
Get out.

25:05.319 --> 25:06.039
You're killing me.

25:07.440 --> 25:08.400
No.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.398
I...

25:30.398 --> 25:30.599
I...

25:30.599 --> 25:31.160
It's dirty now.

25:32.759 --> 25:33.920
I'll keep it.

25:35.960 --> 25:37.799
I'll make you a new one.

25:37.799 --> 25:38.200
I...

25:39.079 --> 25:39.720
Can you check

25:39.720 --> 25:40.599
if maybe

25:40.599 --> 25:41.759
my spine's broken?

26:04.000 --> 26:05.559
Don't mind me. I'm just making a fuss.

26:05.759 --> 26:06.160
It

26:06.240 --> 26:07.319
doesn't hurt at all.

26:13.480 --> 26:15.160
My grandmother used to tell me

26:16.079 --> 26:17.680
the inner household was just
like the court.

26:18.799 --> 26:20.240
If you want people to respect you,

26:20.720 --> 26:21.920
you have to establish
your authority first.

26:24.160 --> 26:25.240
So I thought

26:26.440 --> 26:28.000
when we came to Ganlin,

26:28.359 --> 26:30.119
the first thing we needed
to show everyone

26:30.640 --> 26:32.079
was that we weren't to be pushed around.

26:32.559 --> 26:33.799
But I was wrong.

26:34.559 --> 26:36.079
Instead of backing off,

26:36.960 --> 26:38.480
they only got worse.

26:40.799 --> 26:42.240
And you got hurt because of it.

26:43.880 --> 26:45.160
That's on me.

26:45.799 --> 26:46.920
Don't think like that.

26:49.599 --> 26:50.240
I had a hand

26:50.960 --> 26:52.119
in the plan too.

26:53.240 --> 26:54.599
You grew up in an official's household.

26:55.359 --> 26:56.240
Of course you're not used to

26:56.240 --> 26:57.880
dealing with country folk like them.

26:59.480 --> 27:00.400
But when it comes to

27:01.039 --> 27:02.559
dealing with women like Madam Yan,

27:03.279 --> 27:04.799
no one does it better than you.

27:07.599 --> 27:08.759
Now that we're in Ganlin,

27:09.559 --> 27:10.279
and have to deal

27:10.720 --> 27:12.079
with people like Madam Mo,

27:13.920 --> 27:15.160
you've still got me.

27:17.839 --> 27:19.640
Then I'll be counting on you.

27:20.559 --> 27:21.519
There are two ways.

27:22.160 --> 27:22.960
First,

27:23.519 --> 27:24.720
you use your connections.

27:25.400 --> 27:26.519
Show them the Crown Prince's card.

27:27.839 --> 27:29.400
With the Sixteenth Master's name
behind you,

27:29.839 --> 27:32.319
the leaders' wives, the generals' wives,

27:33.359 --> 27:35.319
even Madam Wang and Madam Mo,

27:35.880 --> 27:37.640
won't dare push you around openly.

27:38.200 --> 27:39.440
But if I do that,

27:40.039 --> 27:41.359
then I've already lost.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.279
Then there's only the second way.

27:46.799 --> 27:47.799
You'll have to

27:49.119 --> 27:50.599
get closer to them.

27:53.119 --> 27:54.519
(Don't let them think)

27:54.839 --> 27:55.960
(you're above them.)

27:57.559 --> 27:58.880
(You have to come down to their level)

27:59.160 --> 28:00.400
(and get your hands dirty.)

28:00.759 --> 28:01.880
(Let them see)

28:02.240 --> 28:03.279
(that you're just like them...)

28:03.680 --> 28:05.519
(someone who eats the same food)

28:05.920 --> 28:07.240
(and feels the same joys and sorrows.)

28:07.880 --> 28:08.759
Has the Zhao household

28:09.000 --> 28:10.400
become a kitchen all of a sudden?

28:10.960 --> 28:12.680
She's a pampered young lady.

28:12.680 --> 28:14.519
To her, this is probably
just playing house.

28:18.039 --> 28:18.680
It's burnt!

28:18.839 --> 28:19.359
Miss Xie!

28:21.440 --> 28:27.120
♪Once a bird in a cage,
longing for the boundless sky♪

28:27.880 --> 28:28.319
It's going to rain!

28:28.319 --> 28:29.240
Miss Xie, it's going to rain.

28:29.240 --> 28:29.799
Quick!

28:29.799 --> 28:30.759
Get the grain inside!

28:30.759 --> 28:31.200
Hurry!

28:31.319 --> 28:32.079
Grab the sacks!

28:32.720 --> 28:33.200
Hurry.

28:33.559 --> 28:34.000
Hurry.

28:35.240 --> 28:36.000
Miss Xie.

28:36.119 --> 28:37.119
Hurry, bring it in!

28:37.119 --> 28:37.599
Quick!

28:37.599 --> 28:38.680
Bring two more sacks.

28:40.720 --> 28:41.759
It's not even your grain.

28:41.759 --> 28:42.440
Why are you in such a rush?

28:42.440 --> 28:43.640
Just keep packing!

28:44.200 --> 28:45.480
I'm helping you, aren't I?

28:45.920 --> 28:46.759
Get it in the sacks!

28:47.320 --> 28:50.880
♪Once a bird among the clouds,
now fallen into the mortal world♪

28:50.880 --> 28:51.480
Hurry.

28:51.480 --> 28:52.359
Everyone, go help.

28:52.640 --> 28:52.960
Got it!

28:52.960 --> 28:53.839
Okay.

28:54.599 --> 28:56.000
Bring another sack over here.

28:57.640 --> 28:58.039
Miss Xie.

28:58.039 --> 28:58.319
Hey...

28:58.720 --> 28:59.240
Miss Xie.

28:59.640 --> 29:00.160
Miss Xie.

29:00.519 --> 29:01.119
Are you okay, Miss Xie?

29:01.119 --> 29:01.480
Quick.

29:01.480 --> 29:02.640
Take this over there.

29:03.200 --> 29:03.839
Take this one.

29:04.799 --> 29:05.240
Hurry.

29:05.319 --> 29:06.079
Everyone, move.

29:06.200 --> 29:07.000
Pick up the pace.

29:07.720 --> 29:08.400
Bag this up.

29:09.680 --> 29:11.480
♪Every light safe and warm♪

29:12.680 --> 29:13.559
You okay?

29:13.559 --> 29:14.119
I'm fine.

29:14.600 --> 29:18.160
♪A life adrift♪

29:19.120 --> 29:22.880
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

29:22.880 --> 29:23.720
I'm done over here.

29:25.040 --> 29:28.040
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

29:30.160 --> 29:31.440
The soldiers are here!

29:31.519 --> 29:32.759
The soldiers are here!

29:32.759 --> 29:37.960
♪I seek no mercy lent by mortal world♪

29:39.160 --> 29:43.360
♪Mortal world♪

29:44.920 --> 29:50.360
♪Let this fleeting world carry me
through a life adrift♪

29:53.000 --> 29:53.640
Come on, hurry!

29:53.640 --> 29:54.240
Help bring it in!

29:54.480 --> 29:54.880
Got it!

29:56.960 --> 29:59.920
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

30:00.839 --> 30:02.480
This rain's ridiculous.

30:02.759 --> 30:03.799
It starts out of nowhere

30:03.799 --> 30:04.839
and stops just as fast.

30:07.039 --> 30:07.799
Hurry.

30:08.119 --> 30:08.759
Coming!

30:14.680 --> 30:15.079
All right.

30:16.960 --> 30:17.559
Give it to me.

30:17.559 --> 30:18.680
Careful not to spill any.

30:18.920 --> 30:19.359
Here.

30:21.759 --> 30:22.519
I didn't expect

30:22.720 --> 30:23.920
you to know how to do this.

30:24.240 --> 30:25.559
I was once a refugee.

30:26.400 --> 30:27.839
I've seen people displaced
from their homes

30:28.200 --> 30:29.599
fight just to eat and stay clothed.

30:30.000 --> 30:30.799
So I know

30:31.599 --> 30:32.759
how precious a full stomach

30:33.079 --> 30:34.480
and warm clothes

30:34.599 --> 30:35.599
can be.

30:39.799 --> 30:41.279
I was too petty before.

30:41.359 --> 30:42.519
Because of me, your man

30:42.519 --> 30:43.480
ended up taking those strokes.

30:46.000 --> 30:46.440
Here.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.079
Let me help.

30:50.079 --> 30:51.160
Don't take this the wrong way,

30:51.880 --> 30:52.720
but around here,

30:52.799 --> 30:54.160
there's a female instructor named Zuo.

30:54.400 --> 30:55.599
Don't get on her bad side.

30:56.480 --> 30:57.519
People around here

30:57.720 --> 30:58.920
think very highly of her.

30:59.519 --> 31:00.880
One bad word from her

31:00.960 --> 31:02.240
carries more weight
than ten other people's.

31:05.000 --> 31:05.880
Madam Mo,

31:06.440 --> 31:07.480
we've got everything packed up.

31:07.480 --> 31:08.880
We're all done here too.

31:08.880 --> 31:10.160
Wonderful. That was quick.

31:11.759 --> 31:12.920
Miss Xie,

31:13.680 --> 31:14.599
thank you.

31:22.120 --> 31:22.920
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

31:22.920 --> 31:23.759
My Lord,

31:24.440 --> 31:25.720
a little higher.

31:26.400 --> 31:27.640
One cun up.

31:28.839 --> 31:29.920
One cun up.

31:37.839 --> 31:40.240
So this is the bearing
of a junior fourth-rank official.

31:40.960 --> 31:42.960
Every bit as lean and striking
as they say.

31:43.799 --> 31:45.319
No wonder

31:45.440 --> 31:47.680
you know just what to say
to please a man.

31:48.119 --> 31:50.359
Compared with the women back home,

31:50.440 --> 31:51.839
you're far more entertaining.

31:54.160 --> 31:55.799
All these years as a widow...

31:56.759 --> 31:58.759
all those lonely nights

31:59.039 --> 32:00.920
have only made you

32:01.480 --> 32:02.880
more captivating.

32:03.559 --> 32:04.519
You only

32:04.519 --> 32:07.000
get better with age.

32:12.720 --> 32:14.240
All you care about is having your fun.

32:14.359 --> 32:15.799
You don't care what happens to me.

32:18.839 --> 32:20.079
My dear,

32:20.079 --> 32:22.039
who in all of Ganlin

32:22.519 --> 32:25.200
would dare threaten your life?

32:25.200 --> 32:26.680
What if

32:27.440 --> 32:29.839
I'm after someone else's?

32:34.440 --> 32:35.200
I'll go change the water.

32:35.200 --> 32:35.599
All right.

32:38.680 --> 32:39.440
Mr. Zhao,

32:39.839 --> 32:41.079
you're still injured.

32:41.240 --> 32:42.279
Why not wash up and change

32:42.279 --> 32:42.680
your dressing

32:42.680 --> 32:43.599
before heading back to camp?

32:46.160 --> 32:47.640
I'll have Sanniang
bring you some clean water.

32:47.640 --> 32:48.240
No need.

32:48.799 --> 32:49.720
Clean water is precious out here.

32:49.839 --> 32:50.920
I'll just use the water
you already used.

32:53.960 --> 32:55.039
(He's actually using)

32:55.039 --> 32:56.839
(my handkerchief and the water
I just used.)

33:16.799 --> 33:18.039
Look at you.

33:19.039 --> 33:20.640
You've already won them over.

33:23.880 --> 33:25.920
I have a good teacher.

33:26.480 --> 33:27.359
But

33:27.920 --> 33:29.480
after all this,

33:30.440 --> 33:32.039
I've been thinking of something else.

33:33.680 --> 33:34.440
Let's hear it.

33:39.119 --> 33:40.200
What if...

33:43.440 --> 33:44.759
you and I

33:44.759 --> 33:45.559
got married here in Ganlin?

33:50.000 --> 33:51.079
Once we're married,

33:51.400 --> 33:52.240
you can

33:52.240 --> 33:53.400
move back home

33:53.400 --> 33:54.519
without having to hide it.

33:55.079 --> 33:56.480
The gossip

33:56.480 --> 33:57.680
will die down too.

33:58.480 --> 34:00.640
No one could use it against you anymore.

34:01.480 --> 34:02.880
It would also help

34:02.880 --> 34:03.839
your career in the army.

34:07.880 --> 34:09.480
I may not be very good at it,

34:10.360 --> 34:11.199
but

34:12.280 --> 34:13.840
I can learn

34:14.000 --> 34:15.880
to be like the other military wives

34:17.440 --> 34:18.280
and make you

34:18.280 --> 34:20.079
clothes for every season.

34:20.960 --> 34:22.519
Whenever you come home on leave,

34:22.920 --> 34:24.360
there'll always be

34:24.360 --> 34:25.880
a hot meal waiting for you.

34:28.639 --> 34:29.840
I think

34:30.280 --> 34:31.280
an arrangement like this

34:31.599 --> 34:32.880
would make things easier for both of us.

34:35.719 --> 34:37.000
So it's just about convenience?

34:54.079 --> 34:55.119
Did you burn your hand?

35:03.039 --> 35:04.280
The water's cold.

35:15.079 --> 35:16.519
Why are you angry?

35:19.880 --> 35:21.360
I'm not exactly angry.

35:23.280 --> 35:24.760
I guess I just...

35:26.840 --> 35:28.039
read too much into things.

35:30.199 --> 35:31.880
We've come this far together.

35:33.119 --> 35:34.679
I don't want there to be

35:34.800 --> 35:36.000
anything between us.

35:36.480 --> 35:38.280
If something's bothering you,
just say it.

35:38.599 --> 35:39.599
Don't hide it from me.

35:45.400 --> 35:47.800
Some things just aren't that easy
to tell you.

35:51.880 --> 35:52.800
You're very clever,

35:54.119 --> 35:55.320
but you don't have to

35:55.719 --> 35:56.760
understand everything.

35:59.480 --> 36:01.480
Your grandmother never taught you this?

36:02.400 --> 36:04.320
But if you teach me,

36:05.280 --> 36:06.719
maybe I would understand.

36:11.760 --> 36:13.800
We agreed to walk this road together,

36:14.280 --> 36:15.639
and you've stayed by my side

36:16.039 --> 36:17.119
through all this hardship.

36:18.679 --> 36:19.880
But somehow,

36:22.039 --> 36:23.159
I still feel so far from you.

36:28.239 --> 36:30.320
That's exactly why I think

36:30.960 --> 36:32.519
we should get married.

36:38.639 --> 36:39.800
I have roll call at camp.

36:40.760 --> 36:41.599
I should get back.

36:48.920 --> 36:49.559
Mr. Zhao,

36:49.880 --> 36:51.239
didn't you say

36:51.239 --> 36:52.280
you wanted to marry Miss Xie?

36:53.360 --> 36:54.199
Now

36:54.199 --> 36:55.320
she's the one asking you,

36:55.920 --> 36:57.199
so why are you upset?

36:59.599 --> 37:00.639
She talked about

37:01.800 --> 37:03.320
the convenience
of being a military wife,

37:04.000 --> 37:05.400
my career,

37:06.599 --> 37:08.400
and our whole life together.

37:09.679 --> 37:10.679
But the one thing she never said

37:14.360 --> 37:16.159
was that she loved me.

37:19.719 --> 37:20.599
I want

37:22.280 --> 37:23.960
a marriage built on love,

37:26.000 --> 37:27.480
not one based on mutual gain.

37:29.079 --> 37:29.679
I'm off.

37:30.239 --> 37:31.159
Be careful.

37:31.800 --> 37:34.800
(The Capital)

37:35.280 --> 37:37.280
(Yu Residence)

37:37.920 --> 37:39.920
This embroidery is exquisite.

37:40.960 --> 37:41.960
Miss Mozhan,

37:42.159 --> 37:43.360
not long ago,

37:43.440 --> 37:44.960
my daughter-in-law had a baby girl.

37:45.360 --> 37:46.719
I'd like to ask you

37:46.719 --> 37:47.800
to make me

37:47.800 --> 37:50.079
a small double-sided embroidered screen
with orchids and osmanthus.

37:50.079 --> 37:51.039
Your embroidery

37:51.039 --> 37:52.960
comes from the Fu family tradition
in Huaying.

37:52.960 --> 37:54.480
There is none finer.

37:54.880 --> 37:56.079
I only wonder

37:56.199 --> 37:58.000
if you'd be willing to do me this favor.

37:58.119 --> 37:59.400
You're too kind, Ms. Shu.

37:59.679 --> 38:01.079
I'd be happy to help.

38:01.079 --> 38:02.599
All social dealings of this household

38:02.599 --> 38:04.079
are handled through the common purse.

38:04.760 --> 38:05.880
Proper procedures

38:05.880 --> 38:06.880
must be followed.

38:07.440 --> 38:08.559
Yet you, Ms. Shu,

38:09.039 --> 38:10.320
went around the steward

38:10.800 --> 38:12.360
and privately assigned one of my maids.

38:12.960 --> 38:14.199
That's hardly proper, is it?

38:14.920 --> 38:15.760
Young Madam,

38:15.960 --> 38:16.440
I...

38:16.519 --> 38:18.360
I only asked for my own sake.

38:18.480 --> 38:20.559
Miss Mozhan's embroidery is so fine.

38:21.000 --> 38:22.639
I thought I'd ask her for a small favor.

38:23.360 --> 38:24.679
I didn't want to trouble the household,

38:25.199 --> 38:27.000
much less bother you, Young Madam.

38:27.480 --> 38:29.079
You've served this family for decades.

38:29.239 --> 38:30.559
Surely you know the rules better
than I do.

38:33.159 --> 38:35.719
Double-sided embroidery
demands absolute precision.

38:36.119 --> 38:37.199
Even after a hundred days' work,

38:37.199 --> 38:39.079
you may not produce a truly fine piece.

38:39.760 --> 38:41.280
Mozhan serves in my quarters.

38:41.519 --> 38:43.159
She already has work to do for me.

38:43.400 --> 38:45.599
If she gets distracted helping
with your little favor,

38:46.119 --> 38:47.719
delaying my own needlework is one thing.

38:48.440 --> 38:50.039
But if her work turns out poorly

38:50.440 --> 38:52.320
and embarrasses the Yu family,

38:52.840 --> 38:53.800
can she

38:54.000 --> 38:55.239
take responsibility for that?

38:56.119 --> 38:57.239
I understand.

39:01.199 --> 39:03.320
Madam, you needn't do this for my sake.

39:03.559 --> 39:06.119
I did put my own wishes first

39:06.480 --> 39:08.079
and broke the household rules.

39:10.000 --> 39:11.280
Who made those rules?

39:12.079 --> 39:13.760
If she dares humiliate you today,

39:14.960 --> 39:17.000
then she clearly has no respect for me.

39:24.720 --> 39:27.120
(Next Episode)

39:27.559 --> 39:29.320
(That new Banner Commander Zhao)

39:29.400 --> 39:30.599
(can refine cliff salt.)

39:30.599 --> 39:31.679
(He'll steal our business
sooner or later.)

39:31.679 --> 39:32.360
Guys,

39:32.480 --> 39:33.320
get him!

39:33.440 --> 39:34.039
Let's go!

39:34.039 --> 39:34.920
Catch them!

39:39.639 --> 39:42.320
(Banner Commander Zhao has been held
by bandits for seven days.)

39:42.800 --> 39:43.880
(By custom,)

39:44.480 --> 39:45.960
(he is to be declared dead in the line
of duty.)

39:46.800 --> 39:48.559
(The Admonitions for Women Hall
has prepared)

39:48.559 --> 39:50.039
(Admonitions for Women)
(a fine quarter for you.)

39:50.400 --> 39:51.360
(Ms. Zuo)

39:51.800 --> 39:53.559
(will guide you properly.)

39:54.000 --> 39:56.199
(Do you know
what the Chastity Tonic is?)

39:56.679 --> 39:57.760
(Drink it,)

39:58.440 --> 40:00.800
(and your skin will decay,)

40:01.440 --> 40:03.119
(your hair will turn white,)

40:04.320 --> 40:06.079
(and you'll never bear children.)

40:20.000 --> 40:24.320
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

40:27.920 --> 40:32.280
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

40:34.400 --> 40:39.040
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

40:39.280 --> 40:42.080
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

40:43.240 --> 40:47.880
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

40:51.080 --> 40:57.920
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

40:58.800 --> 41:05.320
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:06.280 --> 41:09.720
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:10.240 --> 41:14.440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:14.720 --> 41:20.400
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

41:32.520 --> 41:36.400
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

41:40.320 --> 41:44.320
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

41:46.040 --> 41:50.720
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

41:51.040 --> 41:53.720
♪Kept close within my heart♪

41:54.800 --> 41:59.640
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

42:03.160 --> 42:10.080
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:10.960 --> 42:17.440
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

42:18.320 --> 42:21.840
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:22.280 --> 42:26.640
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:26.840 --> 42:32.560
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
